<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 11.76 from 11.87pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 11.76 from 11.87pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month eased to 11.76 from 11.87 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) slipped to 11.24 from 11.32 percent. ATHIBOR</p>
